{
  "name": "Starling",
  "type": "character",
  "img": "systems/heroic5e/assets/characters/starling/Portrait-Starling.png",
  "system": {
    "biography": "Cassidy Donnelly — Starling\n\n“The Hero Everyone Loves”\n\nClass: Vanguard\nOrigin: Enhanced\nCalling: Protector\nSide: Heroic\n\nDescription Starling is one of the city’s newest rising superheroes and quickly becoming one of its most beloved. Young, energetic, and genuinely compassionate, she has earned a reputation for showing up wherever people are in danger: collapsing buildings, transit disasters, bridge failures, apartment fires, and street-level crises alike. While many heroes chase villains, Starling is often the one carrying civilians out of danger while everyone else is still fighting. To the public, Starling represents the kind of superhero people desperately want to believe still exists: hopeful, sincere, approachable, and inspiring. News crews love her. Children adore her. Emergency responders trust her. In many ways, she is the emotional heart of the team and the hero most likely to someday become a major public symbol. Personality Warm, optimistic, compassionate, and deeply people-oriented. Cassidy genuinely believes heroes are supposed to help people first and fight villains second. She is emotionally intelligent, naturally charismatic, and often acts as the glue holding the team together during difficult moments. Even under pressure, she tries to see the best in others. Powers Starling possesses powerful sonic manipulation abilities combined with controlled aerial flight. She can generate focused sonic blasts, powerful concussive shockwaves, vibration fields, and precision sound control capable of disabling enemies, protecting civilians, or manipulating the battlefield. Her powers also allow her to fly with remarkable agility and speed.",
    "notes": "Combat Reference\nPower Die: d8\nProwess: +2\nTrained Saves: DEX, PER.\nTrained Skills: Acrobatics, Athletics, Finesse, Influence, Notice, Streetwise.\nClass & Energy EV (DEX): 16",
